# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/

# Local working folders, not committed (same convention as pushy).
# `input/` is what the owner drops in for me to look at (book photos,
# screenshots, raw art sheets). `output/` is what I write back out (draft
# prompts, previews, progress logs, reports). Accepted art lives in `sprites/`
# with the prompt that produced it in `sprites/prompts/`; both are tracked.
/input/
/output/
my_logs/
my_reports/
.claude/worktrees/
